WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:00.990
Warm.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.190
Someone who is kind, friendly and makes others feel comfortable.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.490
I have some relatives in my family who are very warm people.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.750
In particular I have an uncle where if he is at a family gathering

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:17.590
because he is such a warm person.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:22.990
Because he is someone who is kind, friendly and makes others feel comfortable, he just

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.690
makes the event go better.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.350
I also have a brother-in-law who is like this.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:32.190
He is very warm, he is very friendly, he is very kind and it's just

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.650
a nice kind of person to be around.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:39.330
So if you are warm, you are someone who is kind, friendly

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:41.770
and makes others feel comfortable.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:44.190
Impatient.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.350
This is kind of a little bit different than warm, isn't it?

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:51.210
Someone who gets annoyed easily when things take too long.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:53.350
This is a character trait that I have.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.090
I am sometimes impatient.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:01:01.810
If I'm in the car, we are going to leave at, 8:30 in the morning

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:05.890
to go somewhere and Jen and the kids aren't ready to go.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:08.890
I sometimes get a little bit impatient.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.110
I don't honk the horn.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.890
I'm not rude or anything like that.

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:16.450
But sometimes I am an impatient person.

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:21.010
Someone who gets annoyed easily when things take too long.

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:25.650
Sometimes when Jen and I are going to Toronto, get a little bit

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:29.990
impatient waiting for the train, or I get a little bit impatient,

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.847
at the train station because I know if the train doesn't come

00:01:33.857 --> 00:01:38.187
soon, we will be late for whatever we're going to do.

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:40.287
So again, impatient.

00:01:40.297 --> 00:01:43.727
Someone who gets annoyed easily when things take too long.

00:01:43.737 --> 00:01:44.527
Calm.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:48.667
Someone who stays relaxed and does not get upset easily.

00:01:48.677 --> 00:01:52.107
This is how I would like to be all the time.

00:01:52.117 --> 00:01:57.367
And I'm sure many of you, many of you are probably calm, but many

00:01:57.377 --> 00:02:03.407
of you probably wish you were more calm sometimes when something goes wrong at work.

00:02:03.897 --> 00:02:04.747
Not calm.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.307
I'm impatient.

00:02:06.317 --> 00:02:11.567
I get aggravated easily, but I wish that I was just always calm.

00:02:11.577 --> 00:02:12.367
So calm.

00:02:12.377 --> 00:02:16.547
Someone who stays relaxed and does not get upset easily.

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:20.787
Very thankful that Jen is a calm person.

00:02:20.797 --> 00:02:25.587
She generally does not get upset quickly and she's very calm

00:02:25.597 --> 00:02:29.707
and logical if we are talking about something where we disagree.

00:02:29.717 --> 00:02:30.847
So calm.

00:02:30.857 --> 00:02:34.747
Someone who stays relaxed and does not get upset easily.

00:02:34.757 --> 00:02:36.427
Loyal.

00:02:36.437 --> 00:02:39.167
Someone who stays faithful and supports people they care about.

00:02:39.177 --> 00:02:46.727
When two people are married and they're together for 30, 40, 50 years, they're very loyal.

00:02:47.217 --> 00:02:53.187
I myself have brought my car to the same mechanic since I was 16 years old.

00:02:53.197 --> 00:02:54.767
I'm very loyal.

00:02:54.777 --> 00:02:57.387
You know, I'm faithful, and I support that person.

00:02:57.397 --> 00:02:58.087
So loyal.

00:02:58.097 --> 00:03:01.723
Someone who stays faithful and supports people they care about.

00:03:01.733 --> 00:03:03.403
Courageous.

00:03:03.413 --> 00:03:07.743
Someone who is brave and not afraid to face danger or difficulty.

00:03:07.753 --> 00:03:12.703
I almost always think of firefighters when I think of the word courageous.

00:03:13.153 --> 00:03:17.663
When you are a firefighter, when you arrive at a house that is on

00:03:17.673 --> 00:03:22.683
fire, you have to be very brave, be very courageous, because you

00:03:22.693 --> 00:03:26.443
need to put on all of your safety equipment and you need to go fight

00:03:26.453 --> 00:03:30.723
the fire, and you yourself might get injured.

00:03:30.733 --> 00:03:32.923
There's always a possibility.

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:35.923
Timid.

00:03:35.953 --> 00:03:37.963
Someone who is shy and easily scared.

00:03:37.973 --> 00:03:42.443
So when you are timid, you're not courageous.

00:03:42.453 --> 00:03:43.823
It's kind of the opposite.

00:03:43.833 --> 00:03:48.743
A timid person, maybe doesn't even like talking to other people.

00:03:48.753 --> 00:03:53.183
A timid person would certainly not like doing something new.

00:03:53.193 --> 00:03:58.863
They would rather stay home and do something that they, have always enjoyed doing.

00:03:58.873 --> 00:03:59.523
So timid.

00:03:59.533 --> 00:04:02.903
Someone who is shy and easily scared.

00:04:02.913 --> 00:04:05.043
Sympathetic.

00:04:05.053 --> 00:04:09.263
Someone who understands and cares about another person's feelings.

00:04:09.273 --> 00:04:15.243
So this would be like, if you have a friend who's sick, you could be sympathetic.

00:04:15.253 --> 00:04:20.243
You're like, oh, I feel sad because they're sad.

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:21.383
Okay.

00:04:21.393 --> 00:04:22.963
It means you.

00:04:23.033 --> 00:04:24.443
You're very kind to them.

00:04:24.453 --> 00:04:28.523
It means you understand happening in their life.

00:04:28.533 --> 00:04:29.903
It's good to be sympathetic.

00:04:29.913 --> 00:04:34.700
It's good to understand and care about another person's feelings.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.000
Generous.

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.100
Someone who likes to give and share with others.

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:43.040
So if you are generous and if you.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.440
Let's say this.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:51.200
Let's say one of my kids says, hey, I need $10, or may I have $10

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:53.280
to go out with my friends?

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:55.000
If I was generous, I would give them $20.

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:59.560
I'm someone who likes to give and share with others.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:02.000
And it's not always just about money.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:06.700
You can be generous with your time, you can be generous with your food,

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:09.620
you can be generous with, money.

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:12.440
You could probably be generous with other things as well.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.940
But someone who likes to give and share with others.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.340
Frugal.

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.940
Someone who is careful with money and avoids wasting it.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:27.620
So when you are frugal, when you get your paycheck, you buy the things

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:30.740
you need and you put the rest of the money in the bank.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:36.580
And you don't often buy things that are expensive or that you don't need.

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:41.680
So a frugal person, will even in their life, do things like

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:45.060
try to buy food that's on sale.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:49.320
A frugal person will try to wear the same sweater for 10

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:51.980
years instead of buying a new one, even though the elbows

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.300
are getting a little bit worn.

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:57.860
I think I'm frugal sometimes, but not always.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:59.940
Anyways, a fun word to say, isn't it?

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:00.520
Frugal.

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:04.480
Someone who is careful with money and avoids wasting it.
